silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_06_cheese_trap_typed_vs_unrestricted_sections_01_typed_vs_unrestricted_distinction_concrete_anchor_2_unrestricted#unrestrictednl silm:hasLongDescription "The UnrestrictedNL is raw natural language without gates. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'unrestricted', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
